fforts of our volunteers to provide many benefits including social activities, educational events, companionship, help around the house, <\/span>transportation<span style=\"font-size: large;\">\u00a0and more.<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">If you\u2019re looking to meet neighbors for friendship, shared interests, new experiences and to build a network of support as we take charge of how we age in community together, we\u2019d love to meet you!\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">WPV serves Westchester, Playa del Rey, Playa Vista, Marina del Rey, Del Rey, Mar Vista, Culver City, Ladera Heights, El Segundo, Manhattan Beach and adjacent areas.<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">WE HAVE AN ENGAGING CALENDAR OF ACTIVITIES EACH MONTH. CLICK ON &#8216;WHAT WE DO&#8221; AND &#8220;EVENTS&#8221; TO SEE WHAT&#8217;S COMING UP!<\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">THE FIRST WEEK OF EACH MONTH WE HOLD A HAPPY HOUR OR LUNCH OPEN TO THE PUBLIC TO COME LEARN ABOUT US AND MEET FELLOW MEMBERS. CLICK <a href=\"https:\/\/thewpv.org\/events\/\">HERE<\/a> TO SEE THE NEXT ONE.<\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][\/et_pb_section][et_pb_section fb_built=&#8221;1&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243; custom_margin=&#8221;-90px||-80px||false|false&#8221;][et_pb_row column_struct